NOTICE — WhiteSentinel

WhiteSentinel is built on and extends AdStrike, an open-source Active
Directory attack framework by capture0x (tmrswrr), available at
https://github.com/capture0x/AdStrike under the MIT License
(Copyright 2026 tmrswrr).

The upstream LICENSE file is kept byte-identical in this distribution.
Upstream code, module behavior, and documentation are retained with
attribution; the defensive layer added in this distribution (authoritative
MITRE ATT&CK tagging at source, per-technique detection data, the binary
coverage matrix, the gap register, Sigma rule export with a validation gate,
and the three defensive MCP tools) is new work built on top of the base.

WhiteSentinel is the release name for this distribution.
